## How to respond

For each item above, edit the **Status** line:
- **✓** — "I'll provide it"
- **✗** — "We can't / won't provide it" (acknowledged risk)
- **?** — "Need to investigate — checking with team"

Update the **At-a-glance status** table at the top to match. Items left as ☐ are treated as **?** and re-surfaced at the next checkpoint.

